<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM4.8.3">
<l>marumakaṉtaṉ cantatiyai yuyirmīṭṭu maittuṉaṉmār</l>
<l>urumakattē vīḻāmē kurumukamāyk kāttāṉūr</l>
<l>tirumukamāyc ceṅkamalan tiruniṟamāyk karuṅkuvaḷai</l>
<l>porumukamāy niṉṟalarum puṉalaraṅka meṉpatuvē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>The city of him who, with the face of a guru,</l>
<l rend="indent">restored the life of his nephew’s son</l>
<l rend="indent">[and] rescued the bodies of [his] cousins</l>
<l rend="indent">[from] dying in a sacrifice,</l>
<l>is called Araṅkam,</l>
<l rend="indent">with waters where bloom, standing face to face,</l>
<l rend="indent">red lotuses like [his] holy face</l>
<l rend="indent">[and] dark blue water-lilies like [his] holy body.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
